WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.820
Someone once said...

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.750
There are fields of rye from which

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.760
piping hot fried shrimp 
and fried oysters grow...

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.990
Fryed Fields!

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:04.830
There are dandelions of sweet, 
aromatic sesame dumplings...

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:08.170
Sesame Dumplions!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.710
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:18.310
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:24.890
Super Celeb! Once-in-a-Lifetime 
Gourmet Carriage Journey!

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:31.690
This is a 20-year-old bottle of Crystal Cola.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:38.670
The cork of this bottle was fashioned 
from the trunk of a Crystal Cola Tree.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.170
What a refreshing scent.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.740
And now, the tasting...

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:53.050
Every single fine-textured 
bubble sparkles like crystal!

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.420
Delicious...

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:05.020
It's like top quality champagne...

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:08.530
The flavor is so mellow that I 
can't even believe it's cola!

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:09.900
It's delicious!

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:11.960
You drink some too, Coco!

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:13.070
Sure...

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.970
This cool sensation... is just 
what I'd expect from Crystal Cola.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.740
In nature, Crystal Trees are 
said to take 1,000 years to grow

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:26.380
just a single centimeter of crystals.

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:30.720
It's no wonder high-grade cola is 
made from the seed of that tree.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:34.020
Is Mellow Cola even more delicious than this?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.220
Mellow Cola?

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.790
So the President gave you another 
ridiculous request, huh, Toriko?

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:45.830
Mellow Cola, found in the so-called Gourmet 
Hunter Tomb... the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.270
Our training has been tough, 
but it sounds like Toriko's

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.700
is the most rigorous of all.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.540
Poor guy!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.940
Oh, shut up! Are you sure you 
two are even really training?

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:55.940
Of course!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:04:00.240
I've already cleared the gravity 
challenge and low oxygen level, too...

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.880
Excuse me!

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.650
I'm late!

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:04.920
What were you doing?!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:10.190
S-Sorry! I was admiring my Melk 
Knife and lost track of the time!

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.820
What kind of excuse is that?!

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:12.760
Melk Knife?

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:16.160
Coco-san, Sunny-san, it's been a long time!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.100
The Gourmet Carriage is about to leave.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.160
Right!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.300
The luxurious carriage that requires 
a reservation five years in advance!

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.870
I'm so excited that I get to 
ride in a Gourmet Carriage!

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:26.970
I can't wait!

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:29.240
Hey, don't get carried away!

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:35.240
Wow! It really is huge!

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:40.680
Giga Horses, gigantic horses 
that can travel on land

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:44.550
Giga Horse (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 64

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:44.550
as well as up to a depth 
of 1,000 meters in the sea!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.420
I'm giga-giga-excited now!

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:51.990
The enormous Gourmet Carriage...

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:56.830
I shall be your guide to this 
around the world Gourmet journey.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:08.740
This trip of a lifetime that lasts 
approximately two years begins now...

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.710
See you in two years!

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.950
Actually, I'm getting off next month!

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.490
We're moving!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.650
You're getting too carried away!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.120
It took me five years and 11 months 
after I made my reservation

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.960
and I even dreamed about it, but here 
I am at last on the Gourmet Carriage!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:32.030
Although my budget only allows 
me to make it a one-week trip...

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.540
I'm gonna forget about my jerky chief...

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:37.600
...and have a heaping helping 
of a great time, Kuruppo!

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:41.270
I can't believe the special 
prize for Gourmet Town's lottery

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.280
was this luxury trip!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.110
Th-That was really generous of 'em, huh?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.050
They said it was a ship where you could eat,

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:50.650
so I figured it was just a houseboat.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:53.550
You sure have amazing luck 
of the draw, Zonge-sama!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:58.090
Yeah, maybe next time I'll win the 
grand prize of the Gourmet Lottery!

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:03.900
This is the kind of luck he has...

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:08.930
This is World Connect,

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:12.000
the massive track that connects 
the world's gourmet cities.

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.710
The Gourmet Carriage runs on World Connect,

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:18.140
bypassing various dangerous territories,

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:22.880
and stopping off at the world's gourmet 
cities during its two-odd year tour.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:27.850
Please enjoy the changing scenery 
and the wonderful journey itself.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:34.890
What? What do you want?

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:38.160
That's... Toriko?!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.500
By the way, where are you 
getting off, Sunny-san?

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:46.600
It's not a sightseeing place but the forest

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:48.710
that leads to the Wac Continent's 
Road of Three Hells.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:50.510
Road of Three Hells?!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.810
One of the routes into the Gourmet World?

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.750
Don't tell me you're going 
into the Gourmet World?!

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.550
No, no. I'm not that stupid.

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.520
I'm just going to meet a certain man.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.350
There's only one person who lives 
on the Road of Three Hells.

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:07.260
Sunny, you've got a hard 
journey ahead of you, too.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.990
And where might you be going?

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.560
In about two months, I'll get 
off near the Siddal Kingdom.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.730
Siddal?!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.730
Talk about your "hard journey"!

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:20.000
Siddal, that's not a member of the IGO...

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.970
It's an extraterritoriality where 
gourmet crime runs rampant!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:27.910
S-Sounds like both of you are going 
to have an unusual journey...

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.680
Are you an idiot, Matsu?! You're the 
ones who are going on the toughest trip!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.820
Yeah, I suppose that's true...

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:37.020
After all, we're going 
to the Gourmet Pyramid...

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:39.260
No! Before that!

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:41.020
Before that...?

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.890
In the first place, this carriage 
doesn't go to the Pyramid.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:47.430
That's the first I've heard of it!

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:50.030
Toriko-san! What are they talking about?!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.840
A Solid Gold Whale!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.540
Awesome!

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:58.010
Where are we heading?!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.840
It looks really yummy, doesn't it?!

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.610
Hey, Toriko-san!

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.080
Oh, you'll find out soon enough.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.820
When is "soon enough"?!

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.180
Tomorrow!

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:11.650
That's soon! Tomorrow?!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:15.390
The carriage runs over 
the rail, as if skating.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.860
Everything looks delicious!

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.830
They sure have a variety of food, huh?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.500
Toriko!

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.400
I finally found you!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:01.700
You...

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:02.800
Tina-san!

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.000
Why are you here? On assignment?

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.970
No, I'm totally on vacation!

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.810
Then what's with the camera?

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.780
This is my private camera, just for the trip.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:16.080
But three of the Kings together! I 
smell a heaping helping of a scoop!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:20.090
"Private"?! You're acting 
the way you always do!

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:21.690
Aw, for cryin' out loud!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:27.360
Wherever I go, you lot show up!

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.330
What, are you followin' me?!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.800
Longe-san!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.730
Yeah, I do have long hair...

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.440
I'm Zonge!

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.570
By the way, Toriko...

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:41.140
Don't ignore me!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.440
It's getting lively around here...

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:44.710
You're on the Gourmet Carriage, 
but where are you going?! Tell me!

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:48.450
Those two are completely out of 
tune with this luxury carriage.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:48.450
Don't ignore me, I said! 
Shut up, you cooing bird!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.880
Well, to our first reunion in a while...

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:55.750
Cheers!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:58.360
But there's no food, Komatsu!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:02.830
You ate it all before the toast, Toriko-san!

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:07.060
No worries! There's still a 
lot left, so let's fill up!

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.700
Marbled Tuna!

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.740
This kind of fish loses 
its freshness quickly,

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:15.640
so it's difficult to serve in restaurants, 
but there's a ton of it here!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.110
Incredible!

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:20.080
That's because you get the 
freshest tuna right here!

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:24.210
In fact, there's a school of Marbled 
Tuna alongside us right now!

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.390
"Fresh"?! More like, "just off the hook"!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:32.590
Come on! If you don't eat it 
fast, it'll lose its freshness!

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:33.520
Right!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.890
Thank you for the food!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.800
Delicious!

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:43.100
It feels like it's melting on my tongue!

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.140
I wish this taste would last forever!

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.100
Don't melt...

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.710
Eat as much as you like!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.380
Everything on this carriage 
is all-you-can-eat!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.310
That looks tasty...

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.950
It's juicy roast beef.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.250
Gimme one!

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.320
Just one slice?

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:03.850
Yeah! I'll take this big slice.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:11.030
Juicy cows make juicy roast 
beef! This is the best!

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:14.860
You're munching on a whole roast beef?

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:18.200
Wolfing down everything in sight as usual...

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:23.610
Fill up, boys! I guess 'cause I 
got clout here, the eats are free!

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:26.140
You get special treatment 
when you're famous, huh?

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:26.640
Got that right!

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.080
Look... He said it's all-you-can-eat!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:33.450
Honestly, these people have no business 
being on the Gourmet Carriage!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:53.070
This is it! A wonderful melody...

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:56.400
Paintings and sculptures that make 
you feel the weight of history...

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:01.440
And the scent of vintage wine 
that tickles the nasal cavity...

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.280
All of it fitting in perfectly 
with this voyage...

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.480
Perfectly beautiful...

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:09.950
What the hell do you mean, "dress code"?!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.650
You can't enter the hall dressed like that.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:14.920
What's wrong with our suits?!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.790
I apologize, but rules are rules...

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.190
Cryin' out loud!

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:23.130
Can't you see how cool 
these wild clothes are?!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:27.870
Say, Toriko, you said I would find 
out where you were going tomorrow...

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.640
...but where in the world are you going?!

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.170
Hey! Gimme more wine!

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:34.440
Here you are, sir...

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:35.680
Not that!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:37.380
The whole tray!

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.280
Scoop!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.950
Boy, it doesn't matter where he is. 
Sucking down everything in sight...

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.190
Sunny-san...

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:50.560
Thank you for that last time I saw you.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:56.660
I couldn't really express my thanks 
afterwards, and it bothered me...

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:02.930
Because you gave me the contact information 
for Knocking Master Jiro-san then,

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:07.040
Toriko-san was able to come 
back from the Gourmet World.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:11.640
Thanks to you, Sunny-san, I've been able 
to go on another trip with Toriko-san.

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.650
Thank you, from the bottom of my heart!

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:17.420
You're the one who contacted 
Knocking Master Jiro.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.480
I didn't do anything...

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.720
Sunny-san...

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:25.720
I bet this trip will be more dangerous 
than any you've had before...

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.260
...but don't die on me, Matsu!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.770
A beautiful piece...

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.070
Shall we dance?

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.100
H-H-H-Hey! Huh?!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:44.310
There! Dance beautifully!

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.050
What is this?!

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:51.210
What's going on here?

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:53.320
Why am I dancing with <i>you</i>?!

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:56.920
Don't blame me! There 
wasn't anyone else around!

00:13:56.920 --> 00:14:00.160
Anyway, leave it to me! At the traditional 
festival dance in my village,

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.930
I got everybody givin' me high fives!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.990
I-I feel sick!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:06.260
There he is!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.330
That's the one!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.230
Get back here!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.200
Let go of me!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.700
Zombie-san again...

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.100
Lock him up in the hold!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.800
What's he doing?

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.260
So are you two ready?

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:36.890
Yeah.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.030
Hurry up and show us.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:46.000
So this is the knife that Cutler 
Melk made for you, Komatsu-kun...

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.900
I-It's beautiful...

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.680
Sunny-san, please be careful.

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:56.910
The blade is incredibly sharp.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:01.580
Yeah... I tried to feel it with a strand 
of hair, and it got cut in half.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:07.890
This serious sharpness 
is also... beautiful...

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:10.060
Good for you, Komatsu-kun.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.060
With this, you can get even more 
fired up about your cooking.

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:16.860
Right! Now I can cut even 
more kinds of ingredients,

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:19.830
so it feels like my cooking 
has gotten better!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:24.000
That's right, you were also after 
Melk Stardust. How did that taste?

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.210
You did eat it, didn't you?

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.440
That's...

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.840
That's...

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:33.850
...a secret!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:35.480
That's right!

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:42.260
The taste of the Stardust is a secret 
between Toriko-san, Melk-san, and me!

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:43.290
What?!

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.360
That's disgusting!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.960
You people make me sick!

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:49.030
So the taste of the Stardust 
is a secret too, huh?

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:53.700
You've got quite a few secrets... Toriko.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:57.040
You can tell us, can't you?

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:58.670
Your true purpose here...

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:06.510
Why did you get on this carriage when 
it doesn't go to the Gourmet Pyramid?

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:09.880
I know you have to go <i>there</i> first

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.950
before going to the Pyramid 
to get the Mellow Cola...

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:16.920
U-Um... Exactly where are we heading?

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:21.760
...but getting there via this carriage's 
route is taking the long way around.

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.100
Why did you get on the carriage?

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.860
Actually, that's...

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:28.700
We have an announcement to all passengers.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:32.600
Please take a look out the front 
windows on the left hand side.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.010
You can see the entrance to Hell.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.770
We're going to stop before 
the Gate to the Underworld.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.740
Crap! We're already here?!

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:42.010
What do you mean "we're here"?!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.700
So this is the famous Gate to the Underworld!

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:04.030
The only people who can 
pass through this gate

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:07.370
are vicious prisoners who have 
committed serious crimes.

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:15.080
As all prisoners are given life 
sentences, they never leave this gate.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.850
G-Gate to the Underworld?!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.350
The reason this is called the 
Gate to the Underworld is because

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:29.160
beyond it lies the largest Gourmet 
prison in the world... Honey Prison!

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.290
Hey! Get ready, Komatsu! 
This is where we get off!

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.930
We're getting off here?!

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:38.030
Yeah. There's something I have 
to do at this Gourmet prison.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.100
Gourmet prison?!

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:43.440
We're going to meet Zebra.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:50.150
Z-Zebra... You mean one of the Gourmet 
Hunter Four Kings? That Zebra-san?!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:55.220
I have a heaping helping of a hangover...

00:17:56.080 --> 00:18:01.820
The Gourmet Carriage is safe because 
of the strength of the Giga Horses,

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:04.730
but there are ferocious 
Beasts inhabiting this area

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.830
that could attack even the Horses.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:14.440
Therefore, we will stop 
here for only five minutes.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.940
Hurry up, Komatsu!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.070
O-Okay!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:21.340
Um... Are we really going 
to a Gourmet prison?

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:21.940
Yeah.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:26.380
I-Incidentally, what is Zebra-san like?

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:28.280
He's a troublemaker to the nth degree.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:32.750
But he's strong. If we're going 
to penetrate the Gourmet Pyramid,

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.660
we'll need Zebra's strength!

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:38.660
Although there's no guarantee 
that he'll agree to help...

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.190
Coco...

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:44.760
You wanted to know why I'm on 
board this carriage, didn't you?

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:45.430
Yeah...

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:48.900
When I heard you two would be on this 
carriage, I decided to come along, too...

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.100
...because I have a favor to ask!

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:53.970
In the name of friendship between 
fellow Four Kings Gourmet Hunters...

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:58.080
...would you go with me to see Zebra?!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.110
No way!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.880
Th-That was a fast refusal!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:09.690
All you had to do was go with 
me! You cold-hearted bastards!

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:13.060
Who turns down the chance to see an old 
comrade after not meeting for years?!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:18.400
Th-They have their own objectives 
too, so, uh... they're busy.

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:25.900
But still... he's so bad that Sunny-san 
let alone Coco-san avoided meeting him?

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:28.870
J-Just what kind of a person is Zebra-san?

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:31.710
Oh, well. Let's go, Komatsu.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.680
R-Right!

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:39.880
Toriko! Komatsu-kun! You got off 
at the Gate to the Underworld?!

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.150
I smell a heaping helping of a scoop!

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:44.590
Stop the carriage! I wanna get off!

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:47.190
Once the carriage departs, it doesn't stop.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.960
Zebra, huh?

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.100
This is going to spell trouble again...

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:55.530
Lockin' us up in here! Who 
the hell do they think I am?!

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:58.940
How long do they intend to keep us in here?!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:01.670
Probably until the trip is 
over, two years from now...

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:06.940
By the way, Toriko-san...

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.850
What's in the sack?

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:12.350
It wouldn't be polite to go empty-handed,

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:15.550
so I brought along some 
souvenirs for Zebra...

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:18.160
...although I'm not sure if this is enough.

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:21.630
It's not nearly enough, dumbass!

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.900
Wh-What was that about?!

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:30.800
Zebra... No two ways about it...

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:34.000
But he threw a Sound 
Bullet at this distance?!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.510
We're still dozens of kilometers 
away from the prison...

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.980
That guy must have developed 
his skills more...

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.680
Hey, Zebra! Can you hear me?!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:48.280
Your opening remark to our 
reunion seemed pretty distant!

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.120
Um... Toriko-san...

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:08.440
Hurry up and get here, Toriko...

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.000
Dishing with Tina!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.270
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:19.440
Our guest today is M-san 
from the Gourmet Mafia

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:22.580
and we'll talk to him about a memorable meal.

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:26.610
Hey, who's "M-san"?! And 
what's with this voice?!

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:28.950
Well... This is the usual 
shtick for these things...

00:22:28.950 --> 00:22:31.020
I got no reason to hide!

00:22:31.020 --> 00:22:34.890
I proudly wave the flag of the Gourmet Mafia!

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:38.720
Let's move on to introducing 
your memorable meal, M-san!

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:41.630
So this is a photo of that dinner, right?

00:22:41.990 --> 00:22:46.200
Well, strictly speaking, it wasn't a dinner.

00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:47.330
Hey!

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:51.570
I'm sick of being hidden!

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:54.040
I've had enough of this!

00:22:54.610 --> 00:23:02.080
Please stand by

00:22:55.110 --> 00:22:57.840
Um, Match-san, I mean M-san, calm down!

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:00.510
Now you're not even showin' me at all!

00:23:00.510 --> 00:23:04.620
A-Alright, let's go on to the next segment...

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:09.290
Honey Prison is the largest jail in the world.

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:13.600
Waiting there are vicious death row inmates, a mysterious warden, and that man...!

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:16.390
Finally, He Appears! The Last of the Four Kings, Zebra!

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:18.560
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
